ure inspires a rise in offbeat humour, design and collaboration​</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" dirty="0"/><a:t>Digital natives are rapidly adopting and remixing new forms of self expression. Accustomed to identity-building and socialising online, younger generations – Gen Z in particular – are pioneers of internet communication, mixing and matching various cultural cues, channels and genres to create highly visual messaging.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="13" name="Text Placeholder 12"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{E1BA1B3F-467A-6A51-BE0B-623228C15F5A}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" sz="quarter" idx="14"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="315771" y="1354026"/><a:ext cx="5719346" cy="221599"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" dirty="0"/><a:t>Meme Messaging</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="14" name="Text Placeholder 13"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{FB3F342A-C08A-D7EB-EC7A-E10913BAF139}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" sz="quarter" idx="15"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6253237" y="1354026"/><a:ext cx="5498204" cy="221599"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" dirty="0"/><a:t>Meme Messaging</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="15" name="Text Placeholder 14"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{98CF4BE8-C0B4-25B8-8